<title>NEW ZEALAND: PDL Q1 profit up 73 pct to NZ$3.14 mln.</title>
<headline>PDL Q1 profit up 73 pct to NZ$3.14 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical and plastic goods manufacturer PDL Group said on Wednesday its first quarter post tax profit was up 73 percent up on last year's corresponding quarter to NZ$3.142 million from $1.819 million.</p>
<p>All subsidiary companies were trading well and the group was peforming to budget, PDL said in a statement.</p>
</text>
